<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki says to announce restructuring.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki says to announce restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy said in a statement on Friday it will announce at a 1600/1300 GMTR news conference a significant corporate restructuring.</p>
<p>Trade in Huhtamaki shares was earlier suspended on the Helsinki bourse at the company's own request.</p>
